*Pela primeira vez na região Nordeste!*
*For the first time in the Northeast region!*

**Português:** 
- É imprescíndivel ter lido o [Regulamento da WCA](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations/) antes desta competição;
- A taxa de inscrição terá um valor diferente dependendo de quando você se inscrever, para mais informações, favor consultar a guia [Valor da inscrição](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/CampeonatoBrasileiro2023#32167-valor-da-inscricao-registration-fee-s-value);
- Havendo qualquer dúvida, favor contactar algum dos organizadores ou Delegados listados.

---

**English:** 
- It is mandatory that you have read the [WCA Regulations](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/regulations/) before this competition;
- The registration fee will have a different value depending on when you register, to get more information about it, please check the [Registration Fee's Value](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/CampeonatoBrasileiro2023#32167-valor-da-inscricao-registration-fee-s-value) tab;
- If you still have any doubts, please contact one of the listed organizers or Delegates.

![](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBa0ZBIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--e15184ab34fd24d15417f97a6865e9f26634d758/Logo.png)

#![Bandera ESP](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb0E5IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--c7812c9b5d2929fb4ed7644517bf4f9800a3d1e4/esp.png) **Español**
Si eres socio de la **Asociación Española de Speedcubing (AES)** a día 8 de octubre de 2023 y participas en la competición se te reembolsarán 10€ de la cuota de registro al finalizar ésta. Puedes hacerte socio de la AES pinchando [aquí](https://speedcubingspain.org/register/).

#![Bandera UK](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb0U5IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--2a28e3c285bf55a2606838971abb0514d0ef172c/UK.png) **English**
If you are **Spanish Speedcubing Association (AES)** member on October 8, 2023 and you participate in the competition, you will be reimbursed €10 of the registration fee at the end of the competition. You can join AES by clicking [here](https://speedcubingspain.org/register/).
